	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "PC/104 16-bit bus J1/P1, rows A/B, 2x32, 2.54 mm. Geometry: PC/104 Specification v2.6 Fig. 3/4. Origin = A1, orientation as Fig. 3 (bus edge to +x, pin 32 to -y). Holes 1.02 mm per Samtec ESQ-SDT. Part: Samtec ESQ-132-39-G-D (stackthrough). B10 is the PC/104 key location (no pin on P1, plugged hole on J1). Advantech PCM-3864/3860 name: CN2.")
